     "blocks": [
      {
       "type": "sub",
       "text": "Northstar"
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "The Reserve Club uses Northstar for their POS systems in their Proshop, Lakehouse, and Dining Room. The Reserve Club should try to contact Northstar for support, but there are a few issues that can be dealt with remotely:"
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Common Issues"
      },
      {
       "type": "indent",
       "text": "POS link doesn’t work/redirects to the wrong POS: Clear the cache/cookies, ensure\nthe POS link points to the proper POS link from Northstar\nPOS prints to the same printer: Check to see the POS link points to the right POS\n(example: bix2019cold3, bix2019hot1)"
      },
      {
       "type": "p",
       "text": "Ring Central\nThe club uses RingCentral, and the software is RingCentral; any questions/issues should be forwarded to Artem."
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
